---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Buy Cueport for Mac"
description: "Buy Cueport for Mac and sync the music you own to Cueport for iPhone."
permalink: /buy/
viewportMain: true
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<div class="container download-page">
  <section class="download-sheet" aria-labelledby="download-title">
    <div class="download-main">
      <div class="download-copy">
        <h1 id="download-title">Buy Cueport for Mac.</h1>
        <p class="lede">Build a local music library, keep cues and notes with
          your tracks, and sync selected collections to your phone for offline
          playback.</p>
      </div>

      <aside class="purchase-card" aria-labelledby="purchase-title">
        <div class="purchase-main">
          <p class="purchase-kicker">{{ site.commerce.macPriceLabel }}</p>
          <h2 id="purchase-title">{{ site.commerce.macPrice }}</h2>
          <p class="purchase-summary">One-time license for personal use, with
            one year of feature updates.</p>
        </div>
        {%- if site.commerce.macCheckoutUrl %}
          <a class="purchase-button" href="{{ site.commerce.macCheckoutUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Buy license</a>
        {%- else %}
          <a class="purchase-button" href="#">Buy license</a>
        {%- endif %}
      </aside>

      <section class="download-license-copy" aria-labelledby="license-title">
        <p class="paper-kicker">License details</p>
        <h2 id="license-title">A one-time personal license for Cueport for Mac.</h2>
        <p class="license-lede">Buy once, activate Cueport on up to three Macs
          you personally use, and keep using the version you have after the
          included update year ends.</p>

        <div class="license-copy-grid">
          <section>
            <h3>What you get</h3>
            <p>A signed and notarized Mac app with Serato library import,
              <span class="nowrap">Cueport Direct <span class="status-tag">beta</span></span>, local
              analysis, cue editing, crates, notes, playback, and local sync.</p>
          </section>
          <section>
            <h3>Personal use</h3>
            <p>One license covers one person. You can activate Cueport on up to
              three Macs you personally use. Do not share, resell, or transfer
              the license key.</p>
          </section>
          <section>
            <h3>Updates</h3>
            <p>One year of feature updates is included. Your license does not
              expire, and the app keeps working after that year.</p>
          </section>
          <section>
            <h3>Delivery</h3>
            <p>Your download link and license key are sent by email after
              purchase. Taxes, payment method, and final charge are shown at
              checkout.</p>
          </section>
          <section>
            <h3>Requirements</h3>
            <p>The current DMG is built for Apple silicon Macs. Cueport for
              iPhone is installed separately from the App Store and pairs with
              the licensed Mac app.</p>
          </section>
          <section>
            <h3>Support</h3>
            <p>Read the <a href="/license/">license terms</a>,
              <a href="/refunds/">refund policy</a>, and
              <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>. For activation or
              download questions, email
              <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
